# 行尾统一策略
#
# 背景：Windows 上的 Git 安装常把 core.autocrlf 设为 true，会让工作区在检出时
# 变成 CRLF。本项目跑在 Linux 容器里，代码、SQL 与配置一律 LF 最省事。
# 属性文件的优先级高于 core.autocrlf，因此下面这行足以覆盖本机设置。
* text=auto eol=lf

# 二进制类型：显式声明，避免被当作文本做行尾转换
*.png binary
*.jpg binary
*.jpeg binary
*.gif binary
*.webp binary
*.avif binary
*.heic binary
*.ico binary
*.mp4 binary
*.webm binary
*.mp3 binary
*.ogg binary
*.wav binary
*.flac binary
*.pdf binary
*.onnx binary
*.safetensors binary
*.pt binary
*.pth binary
*.ckpt binary
*.bin binary
*.gguf binary
*.zip binary
*.gz binary
*.tar binary
*.7z binary

# 对行尾敏感的文本类型：显式标注，即使将来有人改了上面的通配也不会波及
*.py text eol=lf
*.sql text eol=lf
*.sh text eol=lf
*.yml text eol=lf
*.yaml text eol=lf
*.toml text eol=lf
*.md text eol=lf
*.json text eol=lf
*.cfg text eol=lf
*.ini text eol=lf
Dockerfile text eol=lf
Makefile text eol=lf
